/patcit><patcit ucid="US-5806361-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>5806361</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HATANAKA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI STEEL CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIURA HIRONORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HATANAKA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI STEEL CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIURA, HIRONORI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HATANAKA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIURA HIRONORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HATANAKA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIURA, HIRONORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A universal rolling mill so designed that even in the type in which the yoke is upwardly retracted, a batch change of rolls including variable-width rolls can be easily made. The universal rolling mill using as horizontal rolls a pair of variable-width rolls having a driving section (housed in a support box) for rolling-width change removably connected to the roll shaft end on the operating side, wherein the yoke for supporting the reaction from an upright roll on the operating side has mounted thereon a transfer device capable of transfer, between itself and the rolling mill, of the driving section for the upper variable-width roll.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un laminoir universel conçu de telle manière que même dans le type de laminoir où l'étrier est rétracté vers le haut, il est possible de procéder rapidement à un changement par lot des rouleaux, y compris les rouleaux de largeur variable. L'invention concerne un laminoir universel utilisant, comme rouleaux horizontaux, une paire de rouleaux de largeur variable à section d'entraînement (logée dans un boîtier de support) permettant de faire varier la largeur de laminage, laquelle paire de rouleaux est connectée libérable à l'extrémité de l'arbre du rouleau côté travail. Dans ce laminoir, un dispositif de transfert, capable de transférer, dudit dispositif au laminoir, la section d'entraînement du rouleau de largeur variable supérieur, est monté sur l'étrier destiné au support de la réaction d'un rouleau vertical côté travail.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>